  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span>렁<ruby>주<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>심<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>졩<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aShyl7xMcMs?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line lyric-muted\">\n    (<ruby>浪子<rt>렁주ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>心情<rt>심ˉ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>)\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    (long-jù’e sīm-jiéng)\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>浪子<rt>렁주ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>心情<rt>심ˉ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    long-jù’e sīm-jiéng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>親像<rt>친ˉ츌-</rt></ruby><ruby>天頂<rt>틸ˉ뎽ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>閃爍<rt>샴ˆ싷</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>流星<rt>류칠ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chīn-chiṵ-thḭ̄-tièng siâm-sih’e liu-chḭ̂\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>浪子<rt>렁주ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>運命<rt>운먀ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    long-jù’e un-miā\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>親像<rt>친ˉ츌-</rt></ruby><ruby>鼎<rt>댤ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>底<rt>되ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>蚼蟻<rt>ᄀᅷˆ햐ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>心理<rt>심ˉ리ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chīn-chiṵ-tiâ̰-toè kâu-hiā’e sīm-lì\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>了解<rt>ᄅᆤˆ개ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>性命<rt>실ˋ먀ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>意義<rt>이ˋ끼ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà ma-si-liâu-kài, sḭ̀-miā’e ì-gī\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>了解<rt>ᄅᆤˆ개ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>𨑨<rt>칟ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>迌<rt>토ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>了<rt>ᄅᆤˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>時<rt>시ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà ma-si-liâu-kài, chît-thó bo-liâu-sí\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>想欲<rt>슐뼇</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>好好<rt>호ˆ호ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>過<rt>궤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>日子<rt>띧즤ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà ma-si-siṵ-beh, hô-hô-lai-kuè-rit-jì\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>想欲<rt>슐뼇</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>想欲<rt>슐뼇</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>重新<rt>뎡신ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>做<rt>죄ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>起<rt>키ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà ma-si-siṵ-beh, goà ma-si-siṵ-beh, tiong-sīn-lai-joè-khì\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <rub